{
  "uid": "shift-happens-performance",
  "title": "Shift Happens \u2014 API performance (k6)",
  "tags": [
    "shift-happens",
    "performance",
    "k6"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "P-01 read p95 (target < 300 ms)",
      "description": "P-01: 95% of representative read requests must finish within 300 ms. The load uses the authenticated GraphQL schedule read; the employee count is the P-04 fixture.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "last_over_time(k6_read_duration_p95{endpoint=\"schedule\",profile=\"baseline\"}[1h])",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.3
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "P-02 write p95 (target < 800 ms)",
      "description": "P-02: 95% of PATCH employee requests through the gateway and Workforce transaction must finish within 800 ms.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "last_over_time(k6_write_duration_p95{endpoint=\"employees\",profile=\"baseline\"}[1h])",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.8
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "P-05 concurrent VUs",
      "description": "P-05: the k6 read scenario runs 200 constant virtual users for the configured duration. This is a local, single-host load test.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "last_over_time(k6_read_vus{profile=\"concurrency\"}[1h])",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 200
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "P-04 employee fixture",
      "description": "P-04: rows returned by the employee read API after the performance fixture was loaded.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(last_over_time(k6_employee_count[1h]))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1000
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Read / write p95 over time",
      "description": "The same metrics used by the P-01/P-02 thresholds. Values are seconds.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(k6_read_duration_p95{endpoint=\"schedule\",profile=\"baseline\"})",
          "legendFormat": "read p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "max(k6_write_duration_p95{endpoint=\"employees\",profile=\"baseline\"})",
          "legendFormat": "write p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "always"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP request rate by scenario",
      "description": "Requests per second sent by k6, split into the read and write scenarios.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (scenario) (rate(k6_http_reqs_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "always"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Check pass rate by scenario",
      "description": "k6 check pass rate. 100% means every read/write check succeeded.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (scenario) (k6_checks_rate{scenario=~\"reads|writes\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "always"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.99
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Iteration rate by scenario",
      "description": "Completed k6 iterations per second. Useful to compare throughput with request latency.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (scenario) (rate(k6_iterations_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "always"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Runbook",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**P-01 / P-02 / P-04 / P-05** are measured by `tests/performance/api.js` with k6 and pushed to this Prometheus through `--out experimental-prometheus-rw`.\n\n```powershell\n$env:PERF_BASE_URL='https://localhost:8443'\n$env:K6_PROMETHEUS_RW_SERVER_URL='http://localhost:9090/api/v1/write'\n$env:K6_PROMETHEUS_RW_TREND_STATS='p(95),p(99),avg,min,max'\nk6 run --out experimental-prometheus-rw tests/performance/api.js\n```\n\nP-03 notification latency is intentionally not part of this k6 suite."
      }
    }
  ]
}
